	quest.1F6E0B3870EEA207.quest_subtitle: "&7Mythical"
	quest.1F6E0B3870EEA207.title: "&d&lVictini"
	quest.1FE5EC7B77697E1F.quest_desc: [
		"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Right, right — held items! I think that’s what they’re called.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\""
		"I mean, really, when you think about it... a Pokémon can hold anything, yeah? But that’s not the point."
		""
		"The point is — I’ve got the best of the best. Well... not all of them, but most. Maybe. Good ones though. Real good."
		"These beauties give Pokémon special effects in battle — real tactical stuff. Probably game-changing. Definitely mysterious."
		""
		"Take these funky glasses — no idea what they do, but they look incredible."
		"This black umbrella? Very ominous. Very protective. Probably rain-related."
		"And this weird ink I found? I mean... cough cough... type-changing ink, yeah. Totally legit. Very experimental. Super rare."
		""
		"So — you want power? Style? Mild confusion?"
		"I got you."
	]
	quest.1FE5EC7B77697E1F.title: "Items To Hold"
	quest.1FF0E8E09400F3E6.quest_desc: [
		"Knowledge, emotion and willpower."
		""
		"&7They only show up for someone who already registered everything."
		""
