	quest.11E1AB8FF7A3D4DB.title: "&ePoké Ball Base"
	quest.11E1AB8FF7A3D4DB.quest_subtitle: "Poké Balls are made with Create"
	quest.11E1AB8FF7A3D4DB.quest_desc: [
		"In this pack &cPoké Balls&r have &lno crafting table recipe&r: they are only made with &6Create&r, on a &6Belt&r, as a &dRecipe Sequence&r (Sequenced Assembly)."
		""
		"Every ball starts from a &ePoké Ball Base&r: an &eIron Sheet&r goes along the belt under a &6Deployer&r with &eIron Nuggets&r, a &6Mechanical Saw&r and a &6Deployer&r with &eIron Sheets&r."
		""
		"Look up the Base in JEI to see the whole sequence."
	]
	quest.4D907A2B1171F5C1.title: "&cPoké Ball Lid"
	quest.4D907A2B1171F5C1.quest_subtitle: "Apricorns become lids"
	quest.4D907A2B1171F5C1.quest_desc: [
		"The top of every ball comes from an &cApricorn&r: a &cRed Apricorn&r passes a &6Mechanical Saw&r and a &6Mechanical Press&r and becomes a &cPoké Ball Lid&r."
		""
		"The other colors make the other lids. Some of them are then painted with a &6Deployer&r (dye) or a &6Spout&r (colored fluid from the &6Mixer&r): a &9Blue Apricorn&r lid plus red dye is a &9Great Ball&r lid, and so on. JEI shows each one."
	]
	quest.48E8EBCDD0ED281A.title: "&6Poké Balls, the Create way"
	quest.48E8EBCDD0ED281A.quest_subtitle: "Lid + Base + Zinc Nugget"
	quest.48E8EBCDD0ED281A.quest_desc: [
		"Now the ball itself: put a &cLid&r on the belt, a &6Deployer&r adds the &ePoké Ball Base&r, another one adds a &7Zinc Nugget&r and a &6Mechanical Press&r closes it. One ball per lid, so one &cApricorn&r per ball, like the old recipe."
		""
		"Make a &9Great Ball&r and an &eUltra Ball&r lid to finish this quest. Every ball of the mod works the same way (the &dMaster Ball&r lid needs a &5Shulker Shell&r and &8Netherite&r, and the ball a &fNether Star&r)."
		""
		"&7Zinc: sieve gravel (Ex Deorum) for Zinc Ore Chunks."
	]
}
